        "TileImage": "$($repository a27e6558-7805-48af-8ef9-42836798938c).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Dubai 47\r\rYour target is an IAGO field operative by the name of Keiji Kono.\r\rKono is belived to be embedded inside the Burj Al-Ghazali&apos;s in-house maintainance team, most likely to gather information on the Sheikh.\r\rWe have been contracted by a third party that has had, &apos;dealings&apos; with the Al-Ghazali family that they would prefer remain discreet.\r\rDiscrection is key 47, IAGO are dangerous, even to us, it is imperative that your remain unseen, and that Kono falls foul of an accident.",
